00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,158
Now the proof.

2
00:00:01,158 --> 00:00:06,848
At the polarizing angle, the reflected and refracted rays are at ninety degrees.

3
00:00:06,848 --> 00:00:15,963
On the top of the surface, the angles round O make a straight line: theta p, plus ninety, plus r, is one eighty.

4
00:00:15,963 --> 00:00:18,424
So r is ninety minus theta p.

